    599  4a0e							; clocks corrects it. k = steps of this beat already played:
    600  4a0e							;   0		the clock is ahead of us: this beat starts now
    601  4a0e							;   1 .. spb/2  we're in step: the rest of the beat counts from the clock
    602  4a0e							;   more	 the clock is early: skip to the next beat, starting now
