    441  5ec2							; ------------------------------------------------------------ tuning
    442  5ec2							; tuneC = PLAYING's FINE TUNE + the Synthcart's TUNE TO (while it's in use),
    443  5ec2							; in cents (-100..+100). The Game Boy gets it as master tune (CC 103), the
    444  5ec2							; NES in its bends (tuneN, 1/64 semitones), the SID in its note frequencies
    445  5ec2							; (SidTune; the notes sounding move at once). MATCH KEY sets the key's root
    446  5ec2							; once, when it changes.
